exports[`preserves the full legacy result-to-done markup and original action order > beta-form 1`] = `"<main class="mdv2-screen screen-content beta-screen" data-stage="beta-form" data-testid="screen-beta-form"><div class="beta-topbar"><button class="icon-button back-button" type="button" aria-label="이전 화면"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.84182 3.13514C9.04327 3.32401 9.05348 3.64042 8.86462 3.84188L5.43521 7.49991L8.86462 11.1579C9.05348 11.3594 9.04327 11.6758 8.84182 11.8647C8.64036 12.0535 8.32394 12.0433 8.13508 11.8419L4.38508 7.84188C4.20477 7.64955 4.20477 7.35027 4.38508 7.15794L8.13508 3.15794C8.32394 2.95648 8.64036 2.94628 8.84182 3.13514Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><img alt="무먹 무엇을 먹든" loading="lazy" width="210" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="beta-brand-wordmark" style="color: transparent;" src="/assets/funnel/brand/mumeok-logo-horizontal.webp"></div><div class="beta-invitation"><img alt="파란 초대장을 든 무먹 소금병 캐릭터" loading="eager" width="210" height="210" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="beta-character" style="color: transparent;" src="/assets/funnel/characters/beta-invitation-mascot.webp"><div class="beta-copy"><h1><span>무먹,</span><br>직접 써보고 싶나요?</h1><p>첫 베타테스트를 준비하고 있어요. 이메일을 남겨주시면 가장 먼저 초대드릴게요</p></div></div><form class="email-form" novalidate=""><label for="beta-email">이메일</label><div class="email-input-wrap"><input id="beta-email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="privacy-details" placeholder="name@example.com" type="email" value=""></div><div class="consent-block"><label class="consent-row"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>[필수]</strong> 이메일 수집·이용에 동의합니다.</span></label><details class="privacy-disclosure"><summary><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.1584 3.13508C6.35985 2.94621 6.67627 2.95642 6.86514 3.15788L10.6151 7.15788C10.7954 7.3502 10.7954 7.64949 10.6151 7.84182L6.86514 11.8418C6.67627 12.0433 6.35985 12.0535 6.1584 11.8646C5.95694 11.6757 5.94673 11.3593 6.1356 11.1579L9.565 7.49985L6.1356 3.84182C5.94673 3.64036 5.95694 3.32394 6.1584 3.13508Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>수집 목적과 보유 기간 보기</summary><p class="privacy-details" id="privacy-details">수집: 이메일 · 목적: 베타 초대 · 보유: 캠페인 종료 후 180일 · <a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a></p></details></div><button class="primary-button" type="submit">무료 베타 초대받기</button></form></main>"`;

